# Fonts are binary, never diff or normalize them.
*.ttf    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.eot    binary

# windows/glaze/config.yaml and windows/yasb/yasb_colors.css are authored with
# CRLF and stored that way. Deliberately NOT marked `eol=crlf`: that would make
# git renormalize the blobs and rewrite both files wholesale. If you edit them
# from macOS, keep the line endings (e.g. `python3` read_bytes/write_bytes, or
# `sed -i '' 's/$/\r/'` after the fact).
